{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34018","headline":"腊後送内大德从勖游天台 · 皮日休","name":"腊後送内大德从勖游天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"讲散重云下九天，大君恩赐许随缘。\n霜中一鉢无辞乞，湖上孤舟不废禅。\n梦入琼楼寒有月，行过石树冻无烟他时瓜镜知何用，吴越风光满御筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}